    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "tb-intro",
        "moduleId": "problem-context",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "教材引例",
        "markdown": "教材通过一个学籍管理关系模式引出讨论：设关系模式 $R<U,F>$，其中属性组 $U$ 包含学生信息及其所在系别、系主任等。当把这些属性放在同一张表中时，会出现一系列操作异常。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000363"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关系数据理论"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6575,
              "lineEnd": 6578,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "4e2a976b7fdbbe7ee01f8d3c2bbb650c89de5421254b522d411c8623588b7ca1"
            },
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000364"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关系数据理论",
                "问题的提出"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6579,
              "lineEnd": 6604,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "2df2b549c03a35af3354e1cc6dacd4395d7934323a175ffbe9b6ce2d2623cb56"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-schema-def",
        "moduleId": "problem-context",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "关系模式的形式化定义",
        "markdown": "教材形式化地描述关系模式为 $R<U,F>$，其中 $U$ 是属性集合，$F$ 是属性间数据依赖的集合。该定义是后续分析异常的出发点。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000365"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关系数据理论",
                "$R<U,F>$"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6605,
              "lineEnd": 6655,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0002/images/cdd235051f4673c071f1211da3db7ca22fd5788241dc80986f218ac24c2ee19b.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "26b74accbdf8fd8b5686d41a17a2600e56cafffabe27d3e659a585318591d914"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-example-table",
        "moduleId": "problem-context",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "example",
        "title": "补充实例表",
        "markdown": "为便于观察，将教材中的学生-系别-系主任信息整理为一张简表。每一行记录包含：学号(Sno)、姓名(Sname)、系名(Sdept)、系主任(Mname)、课程名(Cname)、成绩(Grade)。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-schema-def"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-redundancy",
        "moduleId": "anomaly-analysis",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "数据冗余",
        "markdown": "教材指出，数据冗余是指同一信息在关系中重复存储。例如，每个选修了同一系课程的学生，其系名和系主任信息都会被重复记录。冗余不仅浪费存储，还增加了维护难度。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000366"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关系数据理论",
                "(1) 数据冗余"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6656,
              "lineEnd": 6659,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "f1512b66b942ae2b211bb358a41ca031d22a3374613cb562a5af57e42bbd87a6"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-update",
        "moduleId": "anomaly-analysis",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "更新异常",
        "markdown": "更新异常（update anomalies）指修改关系中某条信息时，由于冗余存储，必须同时修改多处，否则会导致数据不一致。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000367"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关系数据理论",
                "(2) 更新异常（update anomalies）"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6660,
              "lineEnd": 6663,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "318d5b228974bb404361da8b8fbfafc116f4cc6560456753b6af4a6bdb0ff780"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-insert",
        "moduleId": "anomaly-analysis",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "插入异常",
        "markdown": "插入异常（insertion anomalies）指想插入一条记录，但由于缺少某些关键信息（如学生尚未选课就没有课程号和成绩），导致无法构造完整元组，从而合法信息也无法入库。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000368"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关系数据理论",
                "(3) 插入异常（insertion anomalies）"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6664,
              "lineEnd": 6667,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "f71ba2d16fc5d5971a1788410f389a36e085d155aedc3cb15e7c852f96d41c40"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-delete",
        "moduleId": "anomaly-analysis",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "删除异常",
        "markdown": "删除异常（deletion anomalies）指删除某条记录时，会连带删除其他不想丢失的信息。例如，删除某学生唯一的选课记录时，可能把该学生的基本信息也一并删除。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000369"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关系数据理论",
                "(4) 删除异常 (deletion anomalies)"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6668,
              "lineEnd": 6673,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "6a4ee51e01c824648a351dfc60f4c4ff46235516657f8b5f67ddac9b92938c50"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-cause-link",
        "moduleId": "anomaly-analysis",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "模型补充：异常与依赖的关联",
        "markdown": "教材在后续节中揭示，这些异常并非偶然，而是因为属性间存在不恰当的函数依赖：非主属性对码存在部分依赖或传递依赖。把不同主题的属性混在同一张表中，使得操作互相牵制。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-redundancy",
            "tb-update",
            "tb-insert",
            "tb-delete"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-root-cause",
        "moduleId": "root-cause",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "为什么会发生这些问题",
        "markdown": "教材追问异常的根本原因：一个关系模式如果设计不当，属性间的数据依赖没有被合理分离，就会导致存储和操作互相耦合。解决方向是进行规范化，通过模式分解消除不合适的依赖，使每个关系只描述一个主题。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000370"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关系数据理论",
                "为什么会发生这些问题呢？"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6674,
              "lineEnd": 6691,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "4944d05deffad74222291bda6a66bda101a6f1e1a30b6f105e8bb0f88fa02259"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-preview",
        "moduleId": "root-cause",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "下节预告",
        "markdown": "下一知识点将系统学习函数依赖、码和各种范式（1NF、2NF、3NF、BCNF），并掌握如何用它们指导模式分解。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-root-cause"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "exercise-check",
        "moduleId": "check",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "exercise",
        "title": "自检题",
        "markdown": "给定关系模式：选课(学号, 姓名, 课程名, 成绩, 学分)。请指出：\n\n1. 该模式存在哪些数据冗余？\n2. 若修改某课程的学分，会触发什么异常？\n3. 若某学生尚未选课，能否先录入其姓名？为什么？",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-redundancy",
            "tb-update",
            "tb-insert",
            "tb-delete",
            "tb-root-cause"
          ]
        }
      }
